Resolution Strategy:
  - Operation endpoints (mint/bolt11, melt/bolt11):
    Look up in nuts["19"].cached_endpoints by (HTTP method, path keyword)
    Keywords: ["/mint"] for mint, ["/melt","/burn"] for melt, ["/swap"] for swap
  - Quote endpoints (mint/quote/bolt11, melt/quote/bolt11):
    Step 1: Check cached_endpoints (unlikely but handled)
    Step 2: Construct from NUT-04/05 method: /v1/{action}/quote/{method}
    Step 3: Fallback to standard path
  - No mintInfo → standard NUT paths

